### Glungus's Forest API - sample requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
### Run them top to bottom. After login, the token is reused automatically.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Register a new player
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "player1", "password": "hunter2" }

### Log in (grabs a fresh token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "player1", "password": "hunter2" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Load my save
GET {{base}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update my save (as if hitting a checkpoint)
PUT {{base}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": 12, "world": 4, "currency": 350, "data": { "skin": "gold", "pets": ["forest_cat"] } }

### Record a boss kill
POST {{base}}/leaderboard/boss
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public leaderboard, sorted by level
GET {{base}}/leaderboard?sort=level&limit=25

### Public leaderboard, sorted by furthest world
GET {{base}}/leaderboard?sort=world&limit=25
